    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Check out our <a href=\"https://gutenify.com/plugins/gutenify-mega-menu/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">documentation and demos</a> for more information.</p>\n<p>Gutenify Mega Menu is a powerful and flexible mega menu block built specifically for the WordPress Block Editor (Gutenberg). It empowers you to create sophisticated, responsive, and visually stunning navigation menus without any coding.</p>\n<p>The plugin provides a core &#8220;Mega Menu&#8221; block that can be easily styled and populated with various content, including links, submenus, and rich block-based mega dropdowns.</p>\n<h4>Key Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gutenberg Native</strong>: Built using the modern WordPress multi-block API for maximum compatibility.</li>\n<li><strong>Modular Architecture</strong>: Each menu component (Links, Simple Submenus, Mega Submenus) is an independent block for optimized performance.</li>\n<li><strong>Full-Width Mega Content</strong>: Support for a dedicated full-width content area inside mega dropdowns, allowing for complex layouts.</li>\n<li><strong>Highly Customizable</strong>: Control every aspect of your menu, including spacing, colors, borders, and typography.</li>\n<li><strong>Responsive Design</strong>: Automatically handles mobile navigation with smooth transitions and touch-friendly controls.</li>\n<li><strong>Lightweight &amp; Performant</strong>: Clean, modular code ensures your site remains fast and efficient.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>gutenify-mega-menu</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>In the Block Editor, search for the &#8220;Gutenify Mega Menu&#8221; block and add it to your navigation area.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20work%20with%20any%20theme%3F\">\nDoes this work with any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, Gutenify Mega Menu is designed to be compatible with any theme that supports the WordPress Block Editor (Gutenberg).</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"is%20it%20mobile-friendly%3F\">\nIs it mobile-friendly?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Absolutely. The menu is fully responsive and includes specialized accordion behavior and slide-in panels for mobile devices.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20add%20any%20block%20inside%20the%20mega%20menu%3F\">\nCan I add any block inside the mega menu?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, the mega menu dropdown columns support InnerBlocks, allowing you to add paragraphs, images, lists, and more.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed the issue of the mega menu not working properly.</li>\n<li>Include src folder.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release of Gutenify Mega Menu.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A powerful and customizable mega menu block for WordPress, supporting links, images, and rich block-based layouts.",
    "description": "<p>Check out our <a href=\"https://gutenify.com/plugins/gutenify-mega-menu/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">documentation and demos</a> for more information.</p>\n<p>Gutenify Mega Menu is a powerful and flexible mega menu block built specifically for the WordPress Block Editor (Gutenberg). It empowers you to create sophisticated, responsive, and visually stunning navigation menus without any coding.</p>\n<p>The plugin provides a core &#8220;Mega Menu&#8221; block that can be easily styled and populated with various content, including links, submenus, and rich block-based mega dropdowns.</p>\n<h4>Key Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gutenberg Native</strong>: Built using the modern WordPress multi-block API for maximum compatibility.</li>\n<li><strong>Modular Architecture</strong>: Each menu component (Links, Simple Submenus, Mega Submenus) is an independent block for optimized performance.</li>\n<li><strong>Full-Width Mega Content</strong>: Support for a dedicated full-width content area inside mega dropdowns, allowing for complex layouts.</li>\n<li><strong>Highly Customizable</strong>: Control every aspect of your menu, including spacing, colors, borders, and typography.</li>\n<li><strong>Responsive Design</strong>: Automatically handles mobile navigation with smooth transitions and touch-friendly controls.</li>\n<li><strong>Lightweight &amp; Performant</strong>: Clean, modular code ensures your site remains fast and efficient.</li>\n</ul>\n",
